{"resource":{"id":"react-step-by-step-learning-guide","title":"React.js — Step-by-Step Learning Guide","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"23 min","pages":39,"lastUpdated":"July 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A week-by-week React.js learning roadmap — daily study plans, milestones, projects, exercises, portfolio building, and interview prep from beginner to professional."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"week1","label":"Week 1 — JS Refresher & JSX"},{"id":"week2","label":"Week 2 — Components & Props"},{"id":"week3","label":"Week 3 — State & Hooks"},{"id":"week4","label":"Week 4 — Routing & Forms"},{"id":"week5","label":"Week 5 — API & Data Fetching"},{"id":"week6","label":"Week 6 — Performance & Testing"},{"id":"week7","label":"Week 7 — Portfolio Project"},{"id":"week8","label":"Week 8 — Interview Prep"},{"id":"milestones","label":"Milestones & Checkpoints"},{"id":"portfolio","label":"Portfolio Building"},{"id":"career","label":"Career Progression"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Beginner Guide","tag":"Web Development","time":"12 min"},{"title":"React.js — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"44 min"},{"title":"React.js — Practice Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"32 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Follow a structured 8-week plan from JS fundamentals to job-ready React.</li>\n          <li>Complete daily coding exercises and weekly milestones.</li>\n          <li>Ship 3 portfolio projects and prepare for React interviews.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Cadence</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Plan for ~1.5 hours/day, 6 days/week. Adjust to fit your schedule.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 1 — JS Refresher &amp; JSX</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>Days 1–3:</strong> ES6+ syntax, destructuring, spread, arrow functions, promises, async/await. <strong>Days 4–6:</strong> Vite setup, JSX rules, first components.</p>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> Personal profile card component.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — 8-week roadmap: foundations → data → performance → portfolio → interview.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 2 — Components &amp; Props</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Function components, props typing, composition, children prop, conditional rendering, lists with keys.</p>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> Recipe list app with 10+ items.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 3 — State &amp; Hooks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>const [todos, setTodos] = useState([]);\nuseEffect(() =&gt; { fetchTodos().then(setTodos); }, []);</code></pre></div>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> Todo app with local storage persistence.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 4 — Routing &amp; Forms</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>React Router, dynamic routes, nested layouts, React Hook Form + Zod validation.</p>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> Multi-page blog with login form.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 5 — API &amp; Data Fetching</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Fetch API, TanStack Query, loading/error states, optimistic updates.</p>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> GitHub user search with caching.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 6 — Performance &amp; Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>React.memo</code>, <code>useMemo</code>, code-splitting, lazy loading. Vitest + Testing Library.</p>\n        <p><strong>Milestone:</strong> Test coverage &gt; 70% on Todo app.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 7 — Portfolio Project</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Build a full-stack e-commerce cart or task manager: auth, routing, API, tests, responsive design, deployment.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Portfolio architecture: React frontend, REST/GraphQL API, hosted deployment.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"week8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 8 — Interview Prep</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Review hooks, reconciliation, keys, lifecycle, memoization, Context vs Redux, error boundaries. Do 20 coding challenges and 2 mock interviews.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"milestones\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Milestones &amp; Revision Checkpoints</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Week</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Checkpoint</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">2</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Build 5 static components without help</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">4</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Ship a routed multi-page app</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">6</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Debug a slow render with DevTools</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">8</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Answer 30 interview Qs confidently</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"portfolio\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Portfolio Building</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Deploy 3 projects to Vercel. Write a README with screenshots, live link, tech stack, and challenges solved.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Career Progression</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Junior (0–1 yr):</strong> Ship features under review.</li>\n          <li><strong>Mid (1–3 yr):</strong> Own modules; mentor juniors.</li>\n          <li><strong>Senior (3+ yr):</strong> Architecture, performance, hiring.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Consistency beats intensity. Ship small every day. By week 8 you'll have projects, tests, and interview readiness.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I finish in 4 weeks?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes if you commit 4+ hrs/day, but retention is lower without spaced practice.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Should I learn Next.js in parallel?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Focus on React first; Next.js in week 9+.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Study plan is a guide, not a guarantee. Adjust pace to your background.</p>\n      </div></section>"}